ClaimIPORIntegrationConcreteTest
├── when shares zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when shares non zero
   ├── when plasmaVault not allowlisted
   │  └── it should revert with VaultNotAllowed
   └── when plasmaVault allowlisted
      ├── given no pending request
      │  └── it should revert with NoEligibleRequest
      ├── given pending request before keeper release
      │  └── it should revert with NoEligibleRequest
      ├── given claim window expired
      │  └── it should revert with NoEligibleRequest
      ├── given vault has not approved adapter for shares
      │  └── it should revert on transferFrom
      └── given within claim window and shares approved
         ├── it should call redeemFromRequest with owner equal to vault
         ├── it should return assetsReceived to the vault
         ├── it should burn the redeemed shares from the vault
         ├── it should leave zero asset in adapter
         ├── it should leave zero shares in adapter
         └── it should drain the request slot
